      "text": "Congratulations! I'd start with knife skills and a few basics, like a good omelette, a simple soup and a roast."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 22.47,
      "end": 27.99,
      "text": "Then you're ahead already. Still, learning to dice quickly and safely makes every recipe more fun."
    },
    {
